{
  "schema": "yoyo.swplan/1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "polyline + extrude_cut：圆角梯形工具挖方管（两片壁）",
    "units": "mm",
    "note": [
      "背景：R-A 精修把风挡/翼窗的**工具轮廓**从 rect_center/circle 换成 polyline（任意闭合折线）。",
      "  ★ polyline **此前从未和 extrude_cut 组合用过** ⇒ 单独探针（新组合先探，别拿整条 S5 当小白鼠）。",
      "几何：方管 60×40 截面 × 深 40、壁厚 3 ⇒ 体积 25440mm³（同 shell_window_cut.json 的 m1）。",
      "判据：工具 = **圆角梯形**折线，完全落在壁面内 ⇒ 去掉量 = 2 × A × t（两片壁、轴 ⊥ 壁面）**精确**；",
      "  再加 check_faces（只改拓扑的特征 check_body 会假绿，§135）。",
      "★ 这条探针固定住两件事：① polyline 画出的**闭合折线**能被 FeatureCut4 认成轮廓；",
      "  ② 圆角折线（44 段级别的短线段）不会把轮廓弄成「自交 / 不闭合」。"
    ]
  },
  "params": {
    "out": "D:/out"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "n",
      "op": "new_part"
    },
    {
      "id": "p",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Front"
    },
    {
      "id": "sb",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "r",
      "op": "rect_center",
      "cx": 0,
      "cy": 0,
      "w": 60,
      "h": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "se",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "TubeSk"
    },
    {
      "id": "sx",
      "op": "surface_extrude",
      "profile": "TubeSk",
      "depth": 40,
      "name": "Tube1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "op": "check_body",
      "expect_sheet": 1,
      "expect_solid": 0,
      "expect_area_mm2": 8000
    },
    {
      "id": "tk",
      "op": "thicken",
      "targets": [
        "Tube1"
      ],
      "thickness": 3.0,
      "direction": "side1",
      "name": "Wall"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "op": "check_body",
      "expect_sheet": 0,
      "expect_solid": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "op": "check_mass",
      "expect_volume_mm3": 25440.0,
      "vol_tol": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "vbase",
      "op": "check_volume_delta",
      "baseline": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Right"
    },
    {
